## Claude Code Only
- Run tests using: `xcodebuild test -scheme {{ProjectName}} -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=<simulator>'` — the `-destination` is required (without it xcodebuild resolves to a generic iOS device and fails). Pick `<simulator>` from `xcodebuild -showdestinations -scheme {{ProjectName}}`.
- Swiftlint before build
- Write comments in English
- Before start building, ask if I want to make a PR automatically
